      "cadence": "weekly",
      "description": "60-90 min on the current rung's chosen challenge (see the rung\nbrief task). ADR before code. The problems you hit here are what\npull reading and feed Anki.\n\nAI assist rule: Claude may list options or point at docs. Stuck >30 min \u2192 ask for a hint, never the solution. Claude does not write the code in this slot.\n\nClose every session by asking Claude: 'What did I just build that has a known failure mode?' Add the answer to Friday's dive-deeper list.\n",
